  grant <workspace> --db … --level read|write [--relation schema.name …] [--manage]
  revoke <workspace> --db …

TWO ACTORS
  migrate runs as {db}_migrator (owner). k2 db dsn is {db}_agent.
  After each migration file, K2 GRANTs USAGE + table DML + sequences on
